  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2303.03 Application Procedures",
  "priorExpiration": "2024-07-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2303.03 Application Procedures. Any entity meeting the eligibility requirements of Env-Wq 2303.01 and Env-Wq 2303.02 that requests to receive financial assistance from the CMF for a cyanobacteria mitigation project shall file an application by:\n\n(a) Completing an application for a loan or grant or both to reduce the occurrence of cyanobacteria as described in Env-Wq 2303.04;\n\n(b) Signing and certifying the application as described in Env-Wq 2303; and\n\n(c) Submitting the completed, signed eligibility request:\n\n(1) Electronically to the CMF Program Supervisor; or\n\n(2) In writing, by US Postal Service mail, private delivery service, or other in-hand delivery to:\n\nNHDES CMF Program\n\n29 Hazen Drive\n\nP.O. Box 95\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0095\n\nSource. #13858, INTERIM, eff 1-27-24, EXPIRED: 7-25-24\n\nNew. #14078, eff 9-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq2300.html"
}
